                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho abarira Mose, ati Rāba ndaza iy’ uri, ndi mu gicu c’igipfungu c’ inzitane, kugira ngw abantu bumve aho ndiko ndavugana nawe, baheze bakwemere ibihe vyose. Mose abarira Uhoraho amajambo y’abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.9"
            ]
