                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho abarira Mose, ati Genda ku bantu, ubabgire biyeze uyu musi n’ejo, bamesure impuzu zabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umusi ugira gatatu uz’ ushike bīteguye: kuko jewe Uhoraho ku musi ugira gatatu nzomanuka nze kur’ uyu musozi Sinayi imbere y’abantu bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 12:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe uz’ ubashingire akarimbi k’aho bagarukira impande zose, ubabarire, uti Mwiyubare, mwoye kudūga kur’ uyo musozi canke gukora ku rubibe rwawo: ūzokora kur’ uyo musozi ntazobura kwicwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 12:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntihaze hagire ūmukozak’ ukuboko, ariko bamwicishe amabuye, canke bamurase imyampi; naho coba igitungwa kiwukozeko, cank’ umuntu, ivyo ntibize bisubire kubaho. Arikw inzamba ni yaramuka irandishije ijwi, ni ho bazobona gushika kur’ uyu musozi.",
