              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ Uhoraho aramanuka, aza kur’ uwo musozi Sinayi, ku mpinga yawo. Uhoraho ahamagara Mose ngw adūge uwo musozi ashike ku mpinga, Mose aradūga.",
          "type": "text",
