          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose yishura Uhoraho, at’ Abantu ntibashobora kudūga kur’ uyu musozi Sinayi, kuko watubariye ngo tubashingire akarimbi k’aho bagarukira impande zose z’uyu musozi, ngo tuweze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho aramwishura, ati Genda umanuke, uheze uje kudūgana na Aroni: arikw abaherezi n’abandi bantu boye gutwaza ngo baze iyo ndi, kugira ngo simbatsindeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
